---
description: Shop screens must show complete words, never ellipsis
alwaysApply: true
---

# Complete words on every screen

Never cut a shop word short with three dots. Buttons, placeholders, titles, and loading text use the full phrase.

```tsx
// Wrong
{busy ? "Saving..." : "Save"}
placeholder="Find IMEI..."

// Right
{busy ? "Saving this customer" : "Save customer for this shop"}
placeholder="Find IMEI, invoice, supplier bill, or customer"
```

Do not use CSS `truncate`, `text-ellipsis`, or `line-clamp` on names, invoices, IMEIs, or amounts. Let the full value wrap.
